   :reading "Repair-024's successor judgment is a promotion decision over evidence the F11 gates have already produced. Apply the pattern's promotion discipline: publish the strict successful successor link only when an independent receipt matches the repaired revision and the rejected controls (:feature-card-missing-or-invalid named by the mission); a request, a receipt for another revision, or the repair author's own passing tests do not discharge it. When no qualifying receipt exists, retain the typed failure (:awaiting-validation or the typed failure class) WITHOUT resolution -- the want's second disjunct is a retained typed finding, not a stop and not a success."
